  "atomic_questions": [
    "What is the objective of this analysis — are we maximizing the total value of exports (i.e., the value of goods produced for the world market)?",
    "Is the value measured at the world-market prices you listed (steel 500, engines 1500, electronics 300, plastic 1200 Klunz per unit)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for the objective (maximizing export value) and separately confirms the specific pricing basis. These are distinct pieces of information that could be answered independently."
}

